  m_text: "Frans Banninck Cocq (February 23, 1605 \u2013 January 1, 1655), free lord
    of Purmerland and Ilpendam  was a knight, burgemeester (mayor) and military person
    of Amsterdam in the mid-17th century, the Dutch Golden Age.\nHe belonged to the
    wealthy and powerful Dutch patriciate, the regenten, and is best known as the
    central figure in this masterpiece, Rembrandt's The Night Watch."
